{"id": "EUVD-2026-98931", "enisaUuid": "9575060a-fcfa-352c-a24e-5a9b86497837", "description": "Jorani before 1.0.4 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated users to modify, delete, and view other employees' requests by authorizing by operation name only. Attackers can supply numeric request ids to Leaves::edit(), Extra::edit(), Leaves::delete(), Extra::delete(), and Leaves::history() to tamper with colleagues' leave and overtime requests and read leave history.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:59:23", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jorani/jorani/issues/426", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/blob/v1.0.2/application/controllers/Leaves.php#L276-L298", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/blob/v1.0.2/application/controllers/Extra.php#L151-L168", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/commit/59c403224401824489ec662934f71c90d27f614c", "https://github.com/jorani/jorani/releases/tag/v1.0.4", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jorani-before-1.0.4-insecure-direct-object-reference-in-leave-and-overtime-requests"], "aliases": ["GHSA-jhv7-7892-gg9h", "CVE-2026-110098"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "577707c1-2f29-3396-bd3a-8f8035706fd8", "product": {"name": "Jorani", "vendor": {"name": "Jorani"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "67e776f9-7e99-3180-9278-b92f84c7693c", "vendor": {"name": "Jorani"}}], "isExploited": false}